# An opponent's Juggernaut must attack and a Wall cannot block it either (CR 508.1d, 509.1b).

[Bot1 Deck]
Black Lotus
Grizzly Bears
Wall of Wood
Island x20

[Bot2 Deck]
Black Lotus
Mox Emerald
Juggernaut
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Black Lotus.Activate(Color: Green)
Bot1.Hand.Grizzly Bears.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Wall of Wood.Cast
Bot2.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot2.Hand.Mox Emerald.Cast
Bot2.Battlefield.Black Lotus.Activate(Color: Green)
Bot2.Battlefield.Mox Emerald.Activate
Bot2.Hand.Juggernaut.Cast
? Bot2.Mana =
[T4 Bot2.DeclareAttackers]
! Bot2.Attack()
Bot2.Attack(Juggernaut > Bot1)
! Bot1.Block(Wall of Wood > Juggernaut)
Bot1.Block(Grizzly Bears > Juggernaut)
[T4 Bot2.Main2]

[Expect]
Bot2.Battlefield.Juggernaut.Damage = 2
Bot1.Graveyard = Grizzly Bears; Black Lotus
Bot1.Life = 20
